{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44991","headline":"遥和康录事李侍御萼小寒食夜重集康氏园林 · 皎然","name":"遥和康录事李侍御萼小寒食夜重集康氏园林","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"习家寒食会何频，应恐流芳不待人。\n已爱治书诗句逸，更闻从事酒名新。\n庭芜暗积承双履，林蘤雷飞洒幅巾。\n谁见柰园时节共，还持绿茗赏残春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44991.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44991","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}